    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="66">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 66</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be Godes flyman. Gyf hwa Godes flyman hæbbe on unriht, agyfe hine mid rihte ⁊ forgylde ðam ðe hit gebyrige, ⁊ gylde ðam kynincge be wergilde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning excommunicated persons. If anyone unlawfully maintains an excommunicated person, he shall deliver him up in accordance with the law, and pay compensation to him to whom it belongs, and to the king a sum equivalent to his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa Godes flyman hæbbe on unriht, agyfe hine to rihte ⁊ forgilde þam þe hit gebyrige; ⁊ gylde þam cingce be (his) weregylde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
